-- load
<body>
  <main>
    <button id="ignore">"ignore"</button>
    <button id="restart">"restart"</button>
    <button id="queue">"queue"</button>
    <button id="cancel-all">"cancel all"</button>
    <button id="mapped">"mapped"</button>
  </main>
</body>
-- click #ignore
console.info: body: i first 0
console.info: update: i first 0
(the DOM did not change)
